#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-irlock.rst:51
#: 534b5e0b64df4700b4afda0ab65807e5
msgid "The IR-LOCK sensor can be connected directly to the autopilot via an `I2C cable <https://irlock.com/collections/shop/products/pixhawk-cable>`__. If you are using multiple I2C sensors, then you will need an \\ `I2C splitter <https://store.mrobotics.io/mRo-DF13-I2C-Bus-Splitter-for-Pixhawk-p/mro-df13-i2c-split-5-mr.htm>`__. More detailed instructions are included in the `IR-LOCK documentation <https://irlock.readme.io/docs>`__."
msgstr ""

